    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686020/extras/5cc5f259e7739f0447a2a4f1464084bb.poster.avif?t=1755087216\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686020/extras/5cc5f259e7739f0447a2a4f1464084bb.webm?t=1755087216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686020/extras/5cc5f259e7739f0447a2a4f1464084bb.mp4?t=1755087216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faith in Despair</strong> is a grimdark roguelike deck and card builder where you play against Death to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own cards using triggers, actions and modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment and find devastating synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat devious demons and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid full despair and curses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new starter decks with unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% human-made card art</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in active development. Join the Discord to share your suggestions and feedback.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686020/extras/5cc5f259e7739f0447a2a4f1464084bb.poster.avif?t=1755087216\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686020/extras/5cc5f259e7739f0447a2a4f1464084bb.webm?t=1755087216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686020/extras/5cc5f259e7739f0447a2a4f1464084bb.mp4?t=1755087216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faith in Despair</strong> is a grimdark roguelike deck and card builder where you play against Death to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own cards using triggers, actions and modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment and find devastating synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat devious demons and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid full despair and curses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new starter decks with unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% human-made card art</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in active development. Join the Discord to share your suggestions and feedback.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Hell, Faith. Prepare your cards with triggers, actions and modifiers, and play a grim game against Death for eternity.",
